(27, 90, 8, 'Muhammad Saad', 'Saad Khan', '', '1998-03-26', 'none', 'Saad Khan is a TikTok creator known for his engaging and entertaining content. With a passion for creating short-form videos, Saad has amassed a large following on the platform. He is known for his creative editing skills, catchy music choices, and humorous skits. Saad\'s content ranges from lip-syncing to original skits, and he is constantly exploring new ways to engage his audience. In addition to his success on TikTok, Saad is also an avid gamer and enjoys staying up to date with the latest trends in pop culture.', 'upload/profile/2023/1680241594_mVSScZiiDRTyVg9_1651561429159.jpg', 'Mar', '1998', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/MuhammadSaad40?t=WrrKqKdRvPGuioQeJ7S-fA&s=09', 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100014547963031&mibextid=ZbWKwL', 'https://instagram.com/saad_khan2522?igshid=ZDdkNTZiNTM=', 'pending', 1, 0, 90, 0.00, NULL, '2023-03-31 07:26:37', '2023-08-18 15:09:33'),
(28, 91, 1, 'Priya Mani Raj', 'Piya', '', '1984-06-04', 'none', 'In 2013, Priya Vasudev Mani made a special appearance in the song ‘1 2 3 4 get on the dance floor’ from the Bollywood film Chennai Express. Apart from acting, Priya Vasudev Mani has judged many dance reality shows. Priya Vasudev Mani has even walked the ramps for various Fashion Designers. In 2019, Priya Vasudev Mani starred in the Amazon Prime web series ‘The Family Man \'with co-star Manoj Bajpai. Priya Vasudev Mani\'s very recent web show ‘His Story’ starred on Alt Balaji and Zee5. Priya Vasudev Mani has received multiple awards for her contribution to the Indian Film Industry.', 'upload/profile/2023/1680247268_Xx0CGD3dkHzTx4m_Priya.jpg', 'Jun', '1984', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/priyamaniweb?lang=en', 'https://www.facebook.com/PriyamaniOfficial?fref=photo', 'https://www.instagram.com/pillumani/?hl=en', 'pending', 1, 0, 91, 0.00, NULL, '2023-03-31 07:31:51', '2023-08-18 14:31:37'),
(29, 93, 1, 'Urvashi Dholakia', 'vashi', '', '1979-07-09', 'none', 'Urvashi Dholakia was felicitated with the Indian Telly Best Actress in the Negative Role Award in the years 2003, 2004, 2005, 2006 and 2007. In 2010, Urvashi Dholakia won the Indian Telly Best TV Vamp of the Decade Award. She won the Apsara Best Actress in Television Drama Series Award in 2007. Urvashi Dholakia even won the Gold Best Actress in Negative Role (Popular) Award.', 'upload/profile/2023/1680251332_XYBRPuHP1l6QhDb_336543705_197239969664489_8117944655311527334_n.jpg', 'Jul', '1979', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/Urvashi9?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor', 'https://www.facebook.com/urvashiidholakia/', 'https://www.instagram.com/urvashidholakia/?hl=en', 'pending', 1, 0, 93, 0.00, NULL, '2023-03-31 08:33:59', '2023-09-29 17:56:18'),
(30, 95, 1, 'Rakhi Sawant', 'rakhi', '', '1978-11-25', 'none', 'Rakhi Sawant has done the entry dance performance at the 2015 ‘Filmfare Awards’ in Malaysia with ‘Ranveer Singh and ‘Arjun Kapoor’. Rakhi Sawant on March 28 founded the “Rashtriya Aam Party”  to contest in the 2014 Lok Sabha elections from Mumbai North West as an independent candidate, she later resigned from her post and joined the “Republican Party of India”.', 'upload/profile/2023/1680252928_xBfgCVOXSP62J20_197380829_1378391865866939_130946029737456176_n_1623121502172_1674119188971_1674119188971.jpg', 'Nov', '1978', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/rakhisawantt', 'https://www.facebook.com/RakhiSawantOfficialPage/', 'https://www.instagram.com/rakhisawant2511/?hl=en', 'approved', 1, 0, 95, 0.00, NULL, '2023-03-31 09:08:13', '2023-03-31 09:20:07'),
(31, 96, 1, 'Khushbu Patel', 'khushbu', '', '1993-11-10', 'none', 'Khushbu Patel is known for playing the role of Pratiksha in the Hindi comedy serial Taarak Mehta Ka Ooltah Chashmah. Khushbu Patel has also been seen in the Sony TV serial Kaamna and is currently playing a role in the Star Plus Show Kabhi Kabhie Ittefaq Sey.  Khushbu Patel is also set to make an appearance on the big screen in the upcoming movie Ram Setu alongside Akshay Kumar.', 'upload/profile/2023/1680257662_erIfYXbxB80ZZCl_Khushbu Patel.jpg', 'Nov', '1993', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/khushpatel919?lang=en', 'https://www.facebook.com/drkhushbu.patel.31/', 'https://www.instagram.com/khushbupatelofficial/', 'approved', 1, 0, 96, 0.00, NULL, '2023-03-31 10:20:10', '2023-03-31 10:21:57'),
(32, 97, 1, 'Mehwish Hayat', 'Mehwish', '', '1988-01-06', 'none', 'Mehwish Hayat is a Pakistani actress who primarily works in Urdu films and formerly in television. She made her debut in film with comedy Jawani Phir Nahi Ani and later went on to Actor in Law.', 'upload/profile/2023/1680260081_FgwdA78SondF3DU_download.jpg', 'Jan', '1988', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/MehwishHayat', 'https://www.facebook.com/MehwishHayatOfficialPage/', 'https://www.instagram.com/mehwishhayatofficial/?hl=en', 'approved', 1, 0, 97, 0.00, NULL, '2023-03-31 10:58:04', '2023-03-31 11:00:37'),
(33, 98, 1, 'Ayesha Omar', 'Ayesha', '', '1981-10-12', 'none', 'Ayesha Omar is a Pakistani actress and YouTuber. Considered as a style icon in her home country, Omar is one of the most popular and highest-paid actresses of Pakistan.', 'upload/profile/2023/1680260811_J070SCvJ2zY9kYl_download (1).jpg', 'Oct', '1981', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/ayesha_m_omar?lang=en', 'https://www.facebook.com/AyeshaOmarOfficialPage/', 'https://www.instagram.com/ayesha.m.omar/?hl=en', 'approved', 1, 0, 98, 0.00, NULL, '2023-03-31 11:10:24', '2023-03-31 11:12:26'),
(34, 99, 2, 'Usman  SOJABOY', 'SOJABOY', '', '1987-05-11', 'none', 'Usman “Sojaboy” Umar from the 90 Day Fiancé franchise is a multi-talented reality star who has been part of multiple controversies over the years. The 34-year-old Nigerian man debuted on 90 Day Fiancé: Before the 90 Days season 4, during which he married a much older American woman, Lisa “Babygirl” Hamme', 'upload/profile/2023/1680262161_gw1wAt9XARFXKaM_jbBHGQDxNr_avatar-CRCoDISjP.jpg', 'May', '1987', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/OfficialSojaboy?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor', 'https://www.facebook.com/Officialsojaboy14/', 'https://www.instagram.com/officialsojaboy/?hl=en', 'pending', 1, 0, 99, 0.00, NULL, '2023-04-03 05:07:35', '2023-09-29 22:06:42'),
(35, 104, 2, 'Khabib Nurmagomedov', 'The Eagle', '', '1988-08-20', 'none', 'Khabib Abdulmanapovich Nurmagomedov is a Russian former professional mixed martial artist. He competed in the lightweight division of the Ultimate Fighting Championship, where he was the longest-reigning UFC Lightweight Champion ever,', 'upload/profile/2023/1680501149_KTDbBHm8t2q4QSP_khabib.jpg', 'Aug', '1988', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/TeamKhabib', 'https://www.facebook.com/KhabibTheEagle/', 'https://www.instagram.com/khabib_nurmagomedov/', 'pending', 1, 0, 104, 0.00, NULL, '2023-04-03 06:03:30', '2023-09-29 21:28:49'),
(36, 105, 3, 'Jhonny liver', 'Jhonny liver', '', '1947-07-14', 'none', 'Johnny Lever is an Indian actor and popular comedian who is known for his works in Hindi cinema. He is one of the first stand-up comedians in India', 'upload/profile/2023/1680503497_owNk76pRTyjjiNV_jhonny liver.jpg', 'Jul', '1947', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/iamjohnylever?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor', 'https://www.facebook.com/iamjohnylever/', 'https://www.instagram.com/iam_johnylever/?hl=en', 'reject', 1, 0, 105, 0.00, NULL, '2023-04-03 06:35:31', '2023-04-04 11:34:09'),
