(47, 180, 1, 'Zohaib Rana', 'Zohaib', '', '2000-05-05', 'none', 'Whether you\'re an experienced actor or just starting your career, submitting a professional-looking resume when you audition can increase your chances of landing the part. Creating an acting resume that efficiently highlights your experience and qualifications can help you make a positive impression on a casting director.\n\nIn this article, we discuss what an acting resume is and how to format an acting resume, and we offer an example and template to help you write your own.', 'upload/profile/2023/1694683912_2xht0oFUEzDLg9f_red-orange-letter-with-black-background.jpg', 'May', '2000', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/Developer_Rana', 'https://facebook.com/zohaib', 'https://www.instagram.com/zohaib', 'pending', 1, 0, 180, 0.00, NULL, '2023-09-14 15:07:00', '2023-09-29 17:57:12'),
(48, 181, 1, 'Unzila', 'Unzila', '', '2008-06-17', 'none', 'I have dedicated years to honing my craft, studying under experienced mentors, and gaining invaluable experience in both theater and film.My versatility allows me to seamlessly transition between different genres, from intense dramas to lighthearted comedies, and I take pride in adapting to the unique demands of each roleAs an actor, I am committed to continuous growth and self-improvement. I understand the importance of research, preparation, and teamwork in bringing a character to life.', 'upload/profile/2023/1694692282_1MY1qi7nCUYEins_high-fashion-look-glamor-stylish-sexy-smiling-beautiful-sensual-young-woman-model-summer-bright-hipster-clothes-street (2).jpg', 'Jun', '2008', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/JohnDoe', 'https://www.facebook.com/JohnDoe123', 'https://www.instagram.com/john_doe', 'pending', 1, 0, 181, 0.00, NULL, '2023-09-14 17:00:33', '2023-09-14 17:00:33'),
(49, 183, 1, 'Zohaib Rana', 'Zohaib', '', '1910-10-20', 'none', 'I\'m here to help with a wide range of topics and provide information or generate content on various subjects. Please specify the topic or provide more details about what kind of content you\'re looking for, and I\'ll do my best to assist you. Whether it\'s information, advice, a creative story, or something else, feel free to let me know your preferences and requirements.', 'upload/profile/2023/1695030908_f11HyDSpr1stlfN_red-orange-letter-with-black-background.jpg', 'Oct', '1910', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/Developer_Rana', 'https://www.facebook.com/Developer_Rana', 'https://www.instagram.com/Developer_Rana', 'pending', 1, 0, 183, 0.00, NULL, '2023-09-18 15:13:08', '2023-09-18 15:13:08'),
