(52, 186, 1, 'zohaib rana', 'Zohaib', '', '2000-12-03', 'none', 'The actor\'s interpretation of a role—the art of acting—pertains to the role played, whether based on a real person or fictional character. This can also be considered an \"actor\'s role,\" which was called this due to scrolls being used in the theaters. Interpretation occurs even when the actor is \"playing themselves\", as in some forms of experimental performance art.', 'upload/profile/2023/1695118493_joxPolsy1K9gXQa_generic-brandless-modern-sport-car-with-fire-smoke.jpg', 'Dec', '2000', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/Developer_Rana', 'https://www.facebook.com/Developer_Rana', 'https://www.instagram.com/Developer_Rana', 'pending', 1, 0, 186, 0.00, NULL, '2023-09-19 15:21:11', '2023-09-19 15:21:11'),
