(70, 211, 1, 'Sayali Paradkar', 'Sayali', 'TikTok, Marathi Sound, social media', '1999-03-29', 'none', 'was Born on 1999 in Pune, Maharashtra, India and the Present Age of Sayali Paradkar is 23 (Approx. on 2022) and Sayali Paradkar Completed her Studies from Pune City. Sayali Paradkar started her Career from Tik Tok and Create Videos on Marathi Sound, Share Lips Sync, Dance and Acting Videos on Tik Tok, Then Tik Tok Banned on 2020 in India and She has Re-started her Career on Instagram and YouTube, Share Short Videos and Images on her Social Media Account.', 'upload/profile/2023/1695986913_vyBW8lSmK83GfJs_channels4_profile.jpg', 'Mar', '1999', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/paradkarsayali', 'https://www.facebook.com/sayalip123', 'https://www.instagram.com/sayali.paradkar', 'approved', 1, 0, 211, 0.00, NULL, '2023-09-29 16:41:06', '2023-09-29 16:55:40'),
(71, 213, 1, 'Urvashi Dholakia', 'Urvashi Dholakia', 'lux commercial, TV commercial, TV series', '1979-07-09', 'none', 'Dholakia made her acting debut at 6 in a TV commercial for Lux soap with Revathi. As a child she appeared as Rajlaxmi in the Doordarshan TV series Shrikant. Her first TV adult role was in Doordarshan\'s Dekh Bhai Dekh as Shilpa followed by Waqt Ki Raftar.', 'upload/profile/2023/1695990113_lUKhmEjX5qXggoA_0f7c7d3d0fb735513943e4abef8b3d5d.png', 'Jul', '1979', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/urvashi9', 'https://www.facebook.com/urvashiidholakia', 'https://www.instagram.com/urvashidholakia', 'approved', 1, 0, 213, 0.00, NULL, '2023-09-29 17:36:56', '2023-09-29 17:48:53'),
