(73, 215, 5, 'Usman Sojaboy', 'Sojaboy', 'rapper, married, Nigerian Rapper', '1984-08-25', 'none', 'Usman “Sojaboy” Umar from the 90 Day Fiancé franchise is a multi-talented reality star who has been part of multiple controversies over the years. The 34-year-old Nigerian man debuted on 90 Day Fiancé: Before the 90 Days season 4, during which he married a much older American woman, Lisa “Babygirl” Hamme.', 'upload/profile/2023/1696005434_Jt4sr26DCOAL1Az_IMG_6957.jpg', 'Aug', '1984', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/OfficialSojaboy', 'https://www.facebook.com/officialsojaboy', 'https://www.instagram.com/officialsojaboy', 'approved', 1, 0, 215, 0.00, NULL, '2023-09-29 21:46:52', '2023-09-29 22:04:31'),
