(80, 223, 1, 'Mahira Khan', 'Mahira Khan', 'MahiraKhan, PakistaniActress, #Bollywood, MahiraKhanFans, LuxStyleAwards', '1984-12-21', 'none', 'Mahira Khan is a popular Pakistani actress and model. She was born on December 21, 1984, in Karachi, Pakistan. Mahira Khan gained widespread recognition for her role as Khirad Ehsan in the Pakistani television drama serial \"Humsafar,\" which aired in 2011. The show was a major success and helped establish her as one of the leading actresses in Pakistan.', 'upload/profile/2023/1696690978_YO7MQaTxuKXGC91_mahira khan.jpeg', 'Dec', '1984', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/themahirakhan', 'https://www.facebook.com/TheMahiraKhanOfficial', 'https://www.instagram.com/mahirahkhan', 'approved', 1, 0, 223, 0.00, NULL, '2023-10-09 22:36:41', '2023-10-09 22:57:02'),
(81, 225, 1, 'Nabeel Zafar', 'Nabeel Zafar', 'Actor, Bulbulay, Anchor', '1968-09-01', 'none', 'Nabeel is one of the most humble human beings and multi-talented artist we have in our industry who has earned huge respect and huge fame over all these years of his career. He is best known for his comic role in a blockbuster drama serial ‘Bulbulay’. He is also the resident of BOL Entertainment.', 'upload/profile/2023/1696927195_xp416Db0i5ActNx_images.jpeg', 'Sep', '1968', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/nabeelzafar2008', 'https://www.facebook.com/NabeelZafarofficial1', 'https://www.instagram.com/nabeelzafar.official/', 'pending', 1, 0, 225, 0.00, NULL, '2023-10-10 13:45:19', '2023-10-10 13:45:19'),
(82, 226, 1, 'Fawad khan', 'Fawad khan', 'Actor, Model', '1981-11-28', 'none', 'Fawad is one of the most humble human beings and multi-talented artist we have in our industry who has earned huge respect and huge fame over all these years of his career. He is best known for his comic role in a blockbuster drama serial ‘Woh Humsafar tha’', 'upload/profile/2023/1696928408_tFWgECdXRv31b4U_images (1).jpeg', 'Nov', '1981', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/_fawadakhan', 'https://www.facebook.com/Fawad.Afzal.Khan', 'https://www.instagram.com/fawadkhan81', 'approved', 1, 0, 226, 0.00, NULL, '2023-10-10 14:04:29', '2023-10-31 13:46:05'),
(83, 234, 1, 'ahmed khan', 'Sid', 'Actor, Model, Fashion', '1985-01-16', 'none', 'Siddharth Malhotra is a talented Indian actor and model known for his work in the Bollywood film industry. Born on January 16, 1985, in Delhi, India, he began his career as a model before making his acting debut in the 2012 film \"Student of the Year.\" Siddharth quickly gained recognition for his charming looks and acting skills.', 'upload/profile/2023/1698143810_wAVyEyMeVLnl3rM_523469617.jpg', 'Jan', '1985', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/SidMalhotra', 'https://www.facebook.com/s1dmalhotra', 'https://www.instagram.com/sidmalhotra', 'approved', 1, 0, 234, 0.00, NULL, '2023-10-24 15:43:57', '2023-10-24 15:50:54'),
(84, 235, 1, 'zain khan', 'Jaideep Ahlawat', 'Amazon, Netflix, Actor, Movie, Webseries', '1980-02-08', 'none', 'Jaideep Ahlawat is an Indian actor who is known for his work in Hindi films. He is best known for his role Delhi Police Inspector Hathiram Chaudhary, in the Amazon Prime web series Paatal Lok (2020) for which he received several awards including a Filmfare OTT Award for Best Actor in a Drama Series. He has also been receiving accolades for his performance in the Netflix movie Jaane Jaan.', 'upload/artist/2023/1702327537_hdePur1UFelXUkW_eyJidWNrZXQiOiJzdWJtaXRodWIiLCJrZXkiOiJpbWFnZXMvb3JpZ2luYWwvNmtZUUhmOEI3V3ZFWTJmOVcvZHNjMDEzNTQtMTYxMDU2Njk5MjMxOS5qcGciLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOiI1MDAiLCJoZWlnaHQiOiI1MDAiLCJmaXQiOiJjb2.jpeg', 'Feb', '1980', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/JaideepAhlawat', 'https://www.facebook.com/jaideep.ahlawat.56', 'https://www.instagram.com/jaideepahlawat/', 'pending', 1, 0, 235, 0.00, NULL, '2023-11-01 14:31:25', '2024-01-17 16:26:45'),
