(143, 0, 15, 'Ducky Bhai', 'Ducky Bhai', 'youtuber, roaster, vlogger', '1997-12-21', 'none', 'Ducky Bhai, a Pakistani YouTube star, is well-known for his Ducky Bhai channel. His parodies, prank calls, and social media criticism have earned him a following there. Ducky Bhai is without a doubt Pakistan\'s most divisive YouTuber. He is Pakistan\'s first and most well-known roaster.', 'upload/artist/2024/1705416171_0wBgLMPGe9H7afX_Couple-Of-The-Year-Looks-Like-Ducky-Bhai-Sham.jpg', 'Dec', '1997', NULL, NULL, 'https://twitter.com/duckybhai', 'https://facebook.com/duckybhai', 'undefined', 'approved', 1, 0, 289, -20000.00, NULL, '2024-01-16 20:42:50', '2024-07-02 23:13:22'),
