(146, 0, 1, 'ali khan', 'Hania Amir', 'actroess', '1993-01-13', 'none', '📽️ About:\nHania Amir, born on February 12, 1997, is a versatile Pakistani actress and model, celebrated for her captivating performances in television dramas and films. Her on-screen charisma and natural acting talent have made her a beloved figure in the entertainment industry.', 'upload/artist/2024/1719857773_UD7twazUu98sN42_download.jpeg', 'Jan', '1993', NULL, NULL, 'null', 'null', 'null', 'approved', 1, 0, 292, 0.00, NULL, '2024-02-29 01:04:54', '2024-07-01 23:16:17'),
